  "stable_identity_policy": "Existing voltage IDs identify original metas 0,2,3,8,12; add 11 wire and 3 fluid pipe IDs. Preserve old generic pipe/wire IDs. Generic wire shares tin identity; generic pipe stays a separate compatibility network.",
  "thermal_policy": "Original fluid fill accepts temperature <= mTemperature, rejects higher fluids without destroying the pipe, and exposes no drain. Four values derive from the retained original material graph: StainlessSteel1943,W3695,Ad5225,Draconium4500.",
  "routing_policy": "Match original block + metadata through flattened native network identities. Ignore adjacent unrelated material branches. Retain existing loaded-only scan, unique endpoint and 4096-node safety policies; these are documented port limits, not exact source search/unloaded-chunk behavior."
